      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182620\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182620\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Glass sloped more than 15 degrees (0.26 rad) from vertical in skylights, sunrooms, sloped roofs and other exterior applications shall be designed to resist the most critical combinations of loads as determined by Equations 24-2, 24-3 and 24-4.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182621\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182621\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">F<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">g<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t = 0.6<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">W<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">o<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t - <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">D&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 24-2)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182622\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182622\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">F<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">g<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t